This section provides a detailed view of the mathematical model and algorithm of the hybrid Particle Swarm Optimization Generalized Normal Distribution Optimization (h-PSOGNDO) algorithm.
Stage 1: Initialization As stated above, the proposed h-PSOGNDO algorithm is a hybridization of two population-based metaheuristics: PSO and GNDO. Therefore, similar to other algorithms in the same category, in this algorithm, the population is initialized through the following equation: 1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
